From: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:42:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] SPIRV-Cross: include <exception> for std::terminate

Newer libc++ no longer pulls it in through <string>.
---
 deps/SPIRV-Cross/spirv_cross_error_handling.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/deps/SPIRV-Cross/spirv_cross_error_handling.hpp b/deps/SPIRV-Cross/spirv_cross_error_handling.hpp
index e96ebb9a79..61ba2a9a4a 100644
--- a/deps/SPIRV-Cross/spirv_cross_error_handling.hpp
+++ b/deps/SPIRV-Cross/spirv_cross_error_handling.hpp
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <string>
+#include <exception>
 #ifndef SPIRV_CROSS_EXCEPTIONS_TO_ASSERTIONS
 #include <stdexcept>
 #endif
